        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "calico_vyper_convo01",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_01.mp3",
          "text": "It's nice to finally get to work with someone like me.",
          "duration": 3.171
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Calico",
          "audioFile": "nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_02.mp3",
          "text": "I'm nothing like you.",
          "duration": 1.376
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_03.mp3",
          "text": "Come on, we're a couple of tough broads that kill people for money.",
          "duration": 3.942
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Calico",
          "audioFile": "nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_04.mp3",
          "text": "I kill people for money.  You kill people for a pack of cigarettes and a hot meal, we're not the same.",
          "duration": 4.867
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_05.mp3",
          "text": "Sounding a little classist there C.",
          "duration": 3.572
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Calico",
          "audioFile": "nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo01_06.mp3",
          "text": "No I'm sounding a lot classist because I'm nothing like you.",
          "duration": 4.213
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "conversationId": "calico_vyper_convo02",
      "lines": [
        {
          "order": 1,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_01",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_01.mp3",
          "text": "Ya know when I was in the joint I heard stories about you.",
          "duration": 2.46
        },
        {
          "order": 2,
          "character": "Calico",
          "audioFile": "nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_02",
          "audioUrl": "audio/nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_02.mp3",
          "text": "I didn't realize my exploits were things of New Jersey lore.",
          "duration": 3.091
        },
        {
          "order": 3,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_03",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_03.mp3",
          "text": "Not New Jesery, Wisconsin - lots of assassins in Wisconsin.",
          "duration": 4.648
        },
        {
          "order": 4,
          "character": "Calico",
          "audioFile": "nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_04",
          "audioUrl": "audio/nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_04.mp3",
          "text": "Why?",
          "duration": 0.839
        },
        {
          "order": 5,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_05",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_05.mp3",
          "text": "Safehouses are cheap in in Milwaukee? I don't know, the point is word on the street is that you do sloppy work.",
          "duration": 5.541
        },
        {
          "order": 6,
          "character": "Calico",
          "audioFile": "nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_06",
          "audioUrl": "audio/nano_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_06.mp3",
          "text": "Excuse me?",
          "duration": 1.216
        },
        {
          "order": 7,
          "character": "Vyper",
          "audioFile": "viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_07",
          "audioUrl": "audio/viper_match_start_viper_nano_convo02_07.mp3",
          "text": "Something about a hit that went bad?  I don't remember all the details, Wisconsin hooch is top shelf.",
          "duration": 5.981
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
